v 3
d hmerge. Merge m:1 and 1:1 without sorting the master (prototype)
d
d Same syntax and results as merge for m:1 and 1:1 merges, but the master data
d are never sorted: matching uses ordered, direct-address, or hash joins.
d Compiled plugin provided for Apple silicon Macs only;
d on other platforms hmerge notes this and calls merge.
d
d Author: CJ Libassi
d Distribution-Date: 20260925
f hmerge.ado
f hmerge.sthlp
G MACARM64 hmerge_macarm64.plugin hmerge.plugin
G OSX.ARM64 hmerge_macarm64.plugin hmerge.plugin
